<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1.  This statement has been prepared in accordance with the Companies (Indian Accounting Standards) Rules, 2015 (Ind AS) prescribed under Section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013 and other recognised accounting practices and policies to the extent applicable.  n  n2.  The Company is of the view that it manufactures bearings and other related components which is a single business segment in accordance with Ind AS-108- 'Operating Segments' notified pursuant to Companies (Accounting Standards) Rules, 2015.  n  n3.   The Company has adopted Ind AS 116  Leases  effective April 1, 2019 (transition date), which applies to all lease contracts existing on transition date using the simplified approach. On transition date, the adoption of the new standard resulted in recognition of Right -of- Use asset (ROU) and equivalent lease liability of INR 287 million. The effect of this adoption on the profit for the period and the earnings per share is not significant and has been appropriately dealt in these results.  n  n4.  Previous period's figures have been regrouped wherever necessary to conform to current period's classification.  n  n5.  The above financial results were reviewed by the Audit Committee  and approved by the Board at its meeting held on February 6, 2020.  n  n6.  The auditors of the Company have conducted a limited review of the financial results for the quarter and nine months ended December 31, 2019. An unqualified report has been issued by them thereon.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
